Follow START_HERE.md and AGENTS.md in the repo root.
1. Read skills/omni-forge/SKILL.md and skills/ultra-levels/SKILL.md first (default Level 1000), then every skill the task touches.
2. Build from site/ — edit site/config.js first; scenes in site/js/engine.js; UI in site/js/main.js; tokens in site/css/style.css.
3. Preview with `python3 scripts/serve.py`; debug ?scene= ?u= ?m=1 ?level=.
4. Verify with `python3 scripts/check.py site` and the skills/quality-gate checklist before finishing.
5. Ship via .github/workflows (pages, android-apk, desktop-app). Never commit secrets.
